3Content":61},"Tracking notifications","Yes",{"Col1Content":63,"Col2Content":61,"Col3Content":61},"Nearby parking",{"Col1Content":65,"Col2Content":66,"Col3Content":67},"Pay at location","Yes in selected Post Offices","No",{"Col1Content":69,"Col2Content":70,"Col3Content":71},"Opening times","7 days a week, long opening hours","24\u002F7",{"Col1Content":73,"Col2Content":61,"Col3Content":61},"Print",{"Col1Content":75,"Col2Content":76,"Col3Content":77},"Size","120cm length, 245cm circumference","62cm x 57cm x 39cm",{"Col1Content":79,"Col2Content":80,"Col3Content":67},"Packageless returns","Yes, with some retailers",{"SectionTitle":82,"SectionSubtitle":83,"Col1Header":38,"Col2Header":84,"Col3Header":85,"TableFooter":38,"isTableShort":21},"Discover your perfect parcel drop off","With so many parcel drop-off options available, how do you know which one is right for you? At Evri, we recognise that everyone’s situation is different and calls for a different solution, and so in this guide, we intend to showcase the benefits of our various services to help you determine the ideal drop-off point for your parcel. But first, take a look at a quick list of features that might answer any questions you have:","ParcelShop","Locker","information_table$8864725d-b92a-4ada-822e-4910e88f23ea","information_table",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":90,"primary":91,"id":139,"slice_type":140,"slice_label":38},"cardWithImageNoCta",[],{"CardImage":92,"CardAvatar":101,"CardTitle":102,"CardText":103,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":93,"alt":96,"copyright":38,"url":97,"id":98,"edit":99},{"width":94,"height":95},1000,667,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":100,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},470,"none","Find your local ParcelShop or Locker",[104,131],{"type":105,"text":106,"spans":107,"direction":130},"paragraph","Of course, location is among the most important factors  when it comes to dropping off a parcel. We’re partnered with the Post Office and hundreds of other convenient stores across the country, totalling over 9,000+ locations, which means you’re never too far from a ParcelShop. By using our ParcelShop finder tool, you can quickly and easily locate your nearest ParcelShop. ",[108,122,124,129],{"start":109,"end":110,"type":111,"data":112},122,133,"hyperlink",{"id":113,"type":114,"tags":115,"lang":16,"slug":117,"first_publication_date":118,"last_publication_date":119,"uid":120,"url":121,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"ZTpjlREAACYASJI5","content-page",[116],"ParcelShops","how-to-send-through-our-post-office-parcelshops","2023-10-26T13:35:49+0000","2026-04-22T07:30:57+0000","post-office-services","\u002Four-services\u002Fpost-office-services",{"start":109,"end":110,"type":123},"strong",{"start":125,"end":126,"type":111,"data":127},292,314,{"link_type":34,"url":36,"target":128},"_self",{"start":125,"end":126,"type":123},"ltr",{"type":105,"text":132,"spans":133,"direction":130},"We also have conveniently located Lockers across the country, so it may well be that a locker is just around the corner. In fact, when you combine that with our ParcelShop network, 96% of the UK's urban population lives within a mile of one of our locations! You can use our Locker finding tool to check for lockers in your area, in which case, these may be the option for you! ",[134,138],{"start":135,"end":136,"type":111,"data":137},275,294,{"link_type":34,"url":36,"target":128},{"start":135,"end":136,"type":123},"card$8ac1bbfc-c548-43a5-a88f-60e931dbb621","card",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":142,"primary":143,"id":168,"slice_type":140,"slice_label":38},[],{"CardImage":144,"CardAvatar":101,"CardTitle":151,"CardText":152,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":145,"alt":146,"copyright":38,"url":147,"id":148,"edit":149},{"width":94,"height":95},"ParcelShop store assistant is standing at the till and smiling, posing for the photo.","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=36%2C0%2C4550%2C3035&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB",{"x":150,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},36,"Prefer a friendly face?",[153],{"type":105,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":130},"Nothing beats a friendly face when you’re utilising a service. When you visit any of our ParcelShops around the country, you are guaranteed to be accompanied by one of our trained partners who will help make the parcel drop-off experience as easy as possible. Our Print In ParcelShop devices also allow Evri customers to print their labels in-store, so all you need to do is bring your parcel and the code you received when you booked. We’ll take care of handling the package to ensure that it reaches its next destination safely and securely.",[156,167],{"start":157,"end":158,"type":111,"data":159},264,283,{"id":160,"type":114,"tags":161,"lang":16,"slug":162,"first_publication_date":163,"last_publication_date":164,"uid":165,"url":166,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhadqhIAACsA0rN4",[116],"print-in-parcelshop--print-parcel-labels--evri","2022-02-23T21:16:27+0000","2026-03-18T09:48:59+0000","print-in-parcelshop","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",{"start":157,"end":158,"type":123},"card$80573b01-beb3-4f26-9f9e-4098dad5d664",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":170,"primary":171,"id":184,"slice_type":140,"slice_label":38},[],{"CardImage":172,"CardAvatar":101,"CardTitle":179,"CardText":180,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":173,"alt":174,"copyright":38,"url":175,"id":176,"edit":177},{"width":94,"height":95},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":49,"y":178,"zoom":50,"background":51},9,"Keen for a tech-savvy solution?",[181],{"type":105,"text":182,"spans":183,"direction":130},"Maybe you consider yourself an enthusiast of modern technology and are keen to check out the latest in 21st-century parcel sending solutions. Our Lockers utilise touchscreen interfaces, barcode scanners, multiple CCTV security cameras, and unique parcel codes for state-of-the-art parcel handling. You can also divert your parcel into an Evri locker at your desired location, creating an innovative end-to-end digitised courier experience.",[],"card$1aa04624-5bc0-4304-816c-e198b0d966e4",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":186,"primary":187,"id":204,"slice_type":205,"slice_label":38},[],{"title":188,"bodyText":189,"isEco":21,"PaddingTop":21,"PaddingBottom":193,"NoMarginBottom":21,"hasButton":193,"buttonText":194,"buttonLink":195,"image":198},"Use our ParcelShops and Lockers for International Shipping",[190],{"type":105,"text":191,"spans":192,"direction":130},"Did you know that our ParcelShops and lockers accept international parcels? Send to over 200 countries across the world with drop-off locations in your neighbourhood. No extra paperwork required, simply book your parcel online by filling in all of the relevant details, then drop it off at the location of your choice.",[],true,"Send an international parcel",{"link_type":34,"key":196,"url":197},"ae6d9264-2637-490f-92f5-0c68b91445f5","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send",{"dimensions":199,"alt":200,"copyright":38,"url":201,"id":202,"edit":203},{"width":94,"height":95},"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"feature_banner$6ed6f77b-e52c-4b45-859e-c368cd4bff41","feature_banner",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":207,"primary":208,"id":233,"slice_type":140,"slice_label":38},[],{"CardImage":209,"CardAvatar":101,"CardTitle":215,"CardText":216,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":210,"alt":211,"copyright":38,"url":212,"id":213,"edit":214},{"width":94,"height":95},"Customer sat at a desk holding a tape measure with their index finger to measure the size of their parcel.","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R57pbqstJ9-STz_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8600.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R57pbqstJ9-STz",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"Sending a large parcel?",[217],{"type":105,"text":218,"spans":219,"direction":130},"The reality is that no innovation is able to make our lockers infinite in size, as much as we might wish they were. Our largest locker measures 62cm x 57cm x 39cm, which may not be large enough for your parcel. Thankfully, our ParcelShops are able to facilitate our customers looking to send a large parcel with much greater flexibility in the dimensions of the package. Saying goodbye to an old golf club? Evri is there to make sure it finds its new home safely and securely. ",[220,232],{"start":221,"end":222,"type":111,"data":223},287,306,{"id":224,"type":114,"tags":225,"lang":16,"slug":227,"first_publication_date":228,"last_publication_date":229,"uid":230,"url":231,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YjyAUhIAAC8ATRHw",[226],"Our Services","large-parcel-delivery-uk--send-a-heavy-parcel--evri","2022-03-24T14:30:08+0000","2026-05-05T10:57:57+0000","large-parcel","\u002Four-services\u002Flarge-parcel",{"start":221,"end":222,"type":123},"card$33c9aa6f-0556-4e78-a6e8-133bc52a2b86",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":235,"primary":236,"id":262,"slice_type":140,"slice_label":38},[],{"CardImage":237,"CardAvatar":101,"CardTitle":243,"CardText":244,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":238,"alt":239,"copyright":38,"url":240,"id":241,"edit":242},{"width":94,"height":95},"A close-up of a customer sitting on a sofa, holding their phone and looking at the screen. The display shows the 'Track' page for the customer to track where their parcel is on its journey.","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5633.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6XtIZbqstJ9-Wfd",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"Night owl?",[245],{"type":105,"text":246,"spans":247,"direction":130},"The nocturnal lifestyle is thriving in modern society, with more industries than ever accommodating late-night needs, and yet your traditional shipping outlets are still limited to typical opening hours. Almost all of our Lockers, however, are open 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, allowing you to send a parcel at your convenience. CCTV coverage and robust locking mechanisms linked to unique parcel codes mean that security is no issue, even in the remotest locations. ",[248,261],{"start":249,"end":250,"type":111,"data":251},296,309,{"id":252,"type":253,"tags":254,"lang":16,"slug":256,"first_publication_date":257,"last_publication_date":258,"uid":259,"url":260,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YiX9JBIAACsAFthQ","landing-page",[255],"Send a Parcel","why-send-a-parcel-with-evri","2022-03-07T12:41:12+0000","2026-07-09T13:59:25+0000","send","\u002Fsend",{"start":249,"end":250,"type":123},"card$98513ae3-1598-4265-a209-1b1d3f0443bb",{"variation":89,"version":26,"items":264,"primary":265,"id":291,"slice_type":140,"slice_label":38},[],{"CardImage":266,"CardAvatar":101,"CardTitle":272,"CardText":273,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":267,"alt":268,"copyright":38,"url":269,"id":270,"edit":271},{"width":94,"height":95},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"Running low on teabags?",[274,282],{"type":105,"text":275,"spans":276,"direction":130},"Time is a hot commodity, and you might not find the time to make a parcel delivery in your busy schedule, so why not kill two birds with one stone? Our partnerships with the Co-op, One Stop, and many more allow you to shop and send in the same place all across the country. When you book a parcel online on evri.com, you can earn Clubcard Points to further enrich your experience sending and shopping. ",[277,281],{"start":158,"end":278,"type":111,"data":279},303,{"id":252,"type":253,"tags":280,"lang":16,"slug":256,"first_publication_date":257,"last_publication_date":258,"uid":259,"url":260,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},[255],{"start":158,"end":278,"type":123},{"type":105,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":130},"We also partner with local corner shops to integrate straight into your community as a one-stop shop for all your parcel sending needs. Our ParcelShops also boast FREE nearby parking, allowing you to easily drop off all of your parcels and leave with the week's shopping hassle-free. ",[285,290],{"start":286,"end":287,"type":111,"data":288},8,39,{"link_type":34,"url":289,"target":128},"parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"start":286,"end":287,"type":123},"card$6c9612b7-3e32-4682-acc6-9e6915bfe6f0",{"variation":293,"version":26,"items":294,"primary":295,"id":328,"slice_type":140,"slice_label":38},"cardNoImageWithCta",[],{"CardAvatar":101,"CardTitle":296,"CardText":297,"ButtonText":324,"ButtonUrl":325,"IsEco":21},"Made your choice?",[298],{"type":105,"text":299,"spans":300,"direction":130},"We hope this guide has helped you identify which of our amazing parcel drop-off services is best for you. Regardless of which one you choose, we will endeavour to make sure that your parcel is delivered safely and quickly to its destination. Discover additional information about our ParcelShops and Lockers, or head straight to sending your parcel with Evri if you’ve already decided with the link below.",[301,312,313,323],{"start":302,"end":303,"type":111,"data":304},284,295,{"id":305,"type":114,"tags":306,"lang":16,"slug":307,"first_publication_date":308,"last_publication_date":309,"uid":310,"url":311,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhTflBEAACYA1FEy",[116],"parcelshops--parcel-pick-up--drop-off-points--evri","2022-02-22T13:38:47+0000","2026-03-09T20:42:49+0000","parcelshops","\u002Fparcelshops",{"start":302,"end":249,"type":123},{"start":43,"end":314,"type":111,"data":315},307,{"id":316,"type":114,"tags":317,"lang":16,"slug":318,"first_publication_date":319,"last_publication_date":320,"uid":321,"url":322,"link_type":19,"isBroken":21},"YhaXWhIAACwA0p3N",[116],"parcel-delivery--collection-lockers--collect-parcels--evri","2022-02-23T20:43:57+0000","2026-01-05T01:50:51+0000","lockers","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"start":43,"end":314,"type":123},"Send a parcel",{"link_type":34,"key":326,"url":327,"target":37},"c204d857-c8b2-49ae-9430-263ab8bb1de8","parcelshop-or-locker-which-is-best.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend","card$a57e106c-a542-4dd2-b3cc-c1121ec2971b",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":330,"primary":343,"id":345,"slice_type":346,"slice_label":38},[331,337],{"questionTitle":332,"questionBody":333},"Do I have to buy something from the store to send a parcel at a ParcelShop?",[334],{"type":105,"text":335,"spans":336,"direction":130},"Absolutely not, our ParcelShop partners are committed to handling your parcels and providing excellent service regardless of whether you walk in to do a weekly shop or if you just want to send a single parcel.",[],{"questionTitle":338,"questionBody":339},"Are all lockers accessible 24\u002F7?",[340],{"type":105,"text":341,"spans":342,"direction":130},"While the vast majority of our lockers are available 24\u002F7, there are a few that are located within buildings that do have a closing time. This should be clearly labelled on Find my Locker, so you will never run the risk of making a journey only to find a locker inaccessible.",[],{"title":344},"Frequently Asked Questions","frequently_asked_questions$5e763ced-711f-49e5-a51d-1d9f9635c8d2","frequently_asked_questions",[24,56,88,141,169,185,206,234,263,292,329],["Reactive",349],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":350,"$sclients":416,"$sglobal-basket-count":38},{"abtasty":351,"accessibe":354,"appPromoBanner":357,"autoDivertUpdates":360,"awin":363,"bulkInternational":366,"bulkSendEnabled":369,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":372,"enableBasketCount":375,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":378,"euCustomsDuty":381,"groovyAdvert":384,"newInternationalSendFlow":387,"newinternationalpages":394,"oohPreferenceFlag":398,"opentel":401,"premium":404,"savedCards":407,"smallParcelSize":410,"yourPricesDrawer":413},{"_createdAt":352,"_updatedAt":353,"enabled":193},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":355,"_updatedAt":356,"enabled":193},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":358,"_updatedAt":359,"enabled":21},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":361,"_updatedAt":362,"enabled":21},"2026-04-30T13:26:45.107Z","2026-04-30T13:26:45.355Z",{"_createdAt":364,"_updatedAt":365,"enabled":21},"2025-08-19T09:46:14.552Z","2025-09-02T10:23:26.022Z",{"_createdAt":367,"_updatedAt":368,"enabled":193},"2025-06-23T14:37:21.102Z","2026-01-28T10:04:13.631Z",{"_createdAt":370,"_updatedAt":371,"enabled":193},"2024-11-14T16:08:24.373Z","2025-06-05T12:32:29.563Z",{"_createdAt":373,"_updatedAt":374,"enabled":193},"2024-11-14T16:09:05.362Z","2024-11-21T10:37:32.927Z",{"_createdAt":376,"_updatedAt":377,"enabled":193},"2025-10-28T13:17:38.716Z","2026-04-14T10:49:05.879Z",{"_createdAt":379,"_updatedAt":380,"enabled":193},"2025-11-07T14:21:27.204Z